# {{ name }}

Leptos single-page app (client-side rendered, WASM) generated by
[rise](https://github.com/EryyynIT/rise).

## Prerequisites

```sh
rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown
cargo install trunk
```

`rise doctor` checks these for you.

## Run

```sh
trunk serve
```

The SPA is on http://localhost:8080.
{%- if deployment == 'docker' %}

## Docker

```sh
docker build -t {{ name }} .
docker run -p 8080:80 {{ name }}
```

nginx serves the built bundle.
{%- endif %}
